        526.9810791015625,
        82.30619812011719
      ],
      "text": "that participants in the intervention groups (i.e. those undergoing concurrent LC-aNAAT on",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        84.66120147705078,
        526.98095703125,
        97.80619812011719
      ],
      "text": "respiratory samples and LF-LAM on urine) were 1.55 times more likely to be diagnosed with",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        100.16120147705078,
        527.01416015625,
        113.30619812011719
      ],
      "text": "TB within fewer days (relative reduction of 2 days and 1 day to same-day) than those in the",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        115.66120147705078,
        527.0086059570312,
        128.8061981201172
      ],
      "text": "control group. The pooled risk ratio of adult inpatients with HIV diagnosed with TB was 1.56",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        131.16119384765625,
        527.0028686523438,
        144.3061981201172
      ],
      "text": "(95% CI: 1.29–1.88), indicating that the intervention group had 1.56 times the risk of being",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        146.66119384765625,
        526.9656372070312,
        159.8061981201172
      ],
      "text": "diagnosed with TB (either microbiologically confirmed or clinically diagnosed) compared with",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        162.16119384765625,
        526.7453002929688,
        175.3061981201172
      ],
      "text": "the standard of care, which included LC-aNAAT on sputum alone. The pooled risk ratio of adult",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.977978706359863,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        177.66119384765625,
        524.41259765625,
        190.8061981201172
      ],
      "text": "inpatients with HIV with a bacteriologically confirmed TB diagnosis was 3.06 (95% CI: 1.82–",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        193.16119384765625,
        527.304443359375,
        206.3061981201172
      ],
      "text": "5.16), indicating that the intervention group had three times the risk of being microbiologically",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.973769187927246,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        208.66119384765625,
        526.9635620117188,
        221.8061981201172
      ],
      "text": "confirmed with TB compared with the standard of care. Finally, the pooled risk ratio of adult",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        224.16119384765625,
        527.1332397460938,
        237.3061981201172
      ],
      "text": "inpatients with HIV treated for TB was 1.47 (95% CI: 1.25–1.73), indicating that the intervention",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.95937442779541,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        239.66119384765625,
        524.4093017578125,
        252.8061981201172
      ],
      "text": "group had 1.47 times the likelihood of being treated for TB, compared with the standard of care.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.94486141204834,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        264.6487731933594,
        465.75146484375,
        278.7367858886719
      ],
      "text": "Single sample testing in people living with HIV compared with the MRS",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-MdIt",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        290.3874206542969,
        512.7697143554688,
        304.4754333496094
      ],
      "text": "Should LC-aNAATs on respiratory samples be used to diagnose pulmonary TB in",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-MdIt",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        304.7873840332031,
        519.3698120117188,
        318.8753967285156
      ],
      "text": "PLHIV (adults and adolescents) with signs and symptoms or screened positive for",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-MdIt",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        319.1875,
        406.8686218261719,
        333.2755126953125
      ],
      "text": "pulmonary TB, against a microbiological reference standard?",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-MdIt",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        343.9424133300781,
        526.9151000976562,
        357.0874328613281
      ],
      "text": "Twelve studies (2016 participants) evaluated sputum specimens from people living with HIV",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        359.4424133300781,
        526.9652709960938,
        372.5874328613281
      ],
      "text": "( ). The sensitivities ranged between 54% and 100% and the specificities between  Fig. 2.3.1.2",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        374.9424133300781,
        526.9371948242188,
        388.0874328613281
      ],
      "text": "78% and 100%. The summary sensitivity (95% CI) was 87.4% (83.8 to 90.3) and the summary",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        390.4424133300781,
        526.9380493164062,
        403.5874328613281
      ],
      "text": "specificity was 95.2% (92.7 to 96.9). The certainty of evidence for both sensitivity and specificity",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.968705177307129,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
