      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        658.4541625976562,
        176.1481170654297,
        669.2091064453125
      ],
      "text": "negative; TP: true positive.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        687.2010498046875,
        219.8113555908203,
        701.2890014648438
      ],
      "text": "Cost–effectiveness analysis",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-MdIt",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        711.9559326171875,
        526.965576171875,
        725.1009521484375
      ],
      "text": "To date, evidence of cost–effectiveness for concurrent testing is limited. Several studies have",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        727.4559326171875,
        526.9855346679688,
        740.6009521484375
      ],
      "text": "assessed Xpert MTB/RIF with LF-LAM for diagnosing TB among people living with HIV. These",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        742.9559326171875,
        526.9369506835938,
        756.1009521484375
      ],
      "text": "studies have shown that concurrent testing is likely to increase the life expectancy of people",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        758.4559326171875,
        526.9656982421875,
        771.6009521484375
      ],
      "text": "living with HIV and be cost effective compared with using Xpert MTB/RIF in sputum samples",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
